WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Dish Two

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:07.420
We are home!

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:25.400
Happy to serve!

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:28.840
So,

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.440
Any of you here

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:33.880
send me a challenge letter too?

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:34.950
I did!

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:36.320
Me too.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:38.760
Oh, two of you? Lucky me!

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:42.060
Good timing! I was just about to start.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:43.590
If you don't mind.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:45.300
Oh? Don't tell me...

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:46.820
Right.

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:49.170
Ok, I'm fine with that.

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:51.420
Bring me my knives!

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:51.950
Yes!

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.890
He challenged them to Shokugeki?

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:55.840
Eeeeeh?!

00:00:58.580 --> 00:00:59.560
What speed!

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.190
What? What is this scent?

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.170
Two people at the same time?

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:06.100
Amazing!

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:08.880
I'm finished!

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.860
Looks delicious!

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:15.010
Happy to serve!

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:19.730
-So?  -Did Yukihira win?

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:22.970
Yes, he somehow it was a victory.

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.380
Only Fumio-san's fish remains.

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:28.630
Well, someone will eat it.

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:30.830
Ohh, what a flavor!

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:34.970
This tastes awesome!

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:38.040
<i>Who is this? I have never seen her before.</i>

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:40.350
<i>High school? Maybe third year?</i>

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:43.460
Oh, my bad, my bad. I was so delicious!

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:45.410
Ah no, don't worry.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:50.170
Thank you, Yukihira Souma!

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:52.210
He won all three Shokugekis?!

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:54.100
And two at the same time!

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.580
<i>He was fortunate that two
of them were students.</i>

00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:59.800
Oh, Issiki senpai is here?

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:01.580
I wonder who is he with.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:48.310
So, everyone has gathered.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.860
Let us get down to business.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:54.330
Annual meeting of Maple leaves.

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:57.230
A notice

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.470
has been completed!!!

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:04.030
What do you think about
maple leaf I painted?

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:07.360
I think it turned out pretty good.

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:11.140
Yeah, the brown color is pretty good

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:15.070
I would have preferred a
font with more pop to it

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:19.900
If the font is too informal,
it will lose seriousness.

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:24.320
Hmm, yes, Momji meet and greet
is venerable school event

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:27.580
where students from different class
and year can meet and socialize

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:32.000
This year, for the first time at Maple meeting
event, there will be new participants

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:38.570
It is responsibility of current
Elite 10 to hold the meeting.

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:41.070
I'll be depending on you.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:45.100
That's the message from school top.

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:50.180
Eeeh, this fish is not bad!

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:52.190
I can't wait for it!

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:55.360
Fumio-san sent us some.

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:58.300
Ok, it's ready!

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.110
Ohh, it's so toasty!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:02.180
Looks delicious!

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:04.160
Mito-san, come on.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:05.240
O-ok.

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.870
We'll taste it too!

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:08.040
Yes!

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:09.800
Thank you for the food!

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:16.450
Delicious!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.040
Juicy!

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.950
Only Souma could prepare
something like this!

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:25.960
Because of all the flavor,
my boobs are all jiggling!

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:27.310
Oohhhhh!

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:32.730
Oh, this is just saury in maple syrup.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:34.780
No need to experiment on us!!!

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.030
Is this all saury?

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.870
Yes, you can take all you want.

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:44.770
There are chocolate sauce, condensed
milk, habanero and ramune.

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:47.470
Ok, down with all these!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:51.480
I smelled something nice!
Did you roast saury?

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:53.210
Isshiki-senpai?

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:56.990
I'd wanted to talk with Souma and Tadokoro.

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:58.060
Is it ok?

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:02.710
Eeeh?! An Elite Ten?

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:04.500
Red leaf hunt convention?

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:06.410
Yes, we'll be hosting current
Elite Ten members, as well

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:10.440
as well as eight selected students who
were in the preliminaries.

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:14.250
Eeeh... Will it be like Stagiare?

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:17.160
If we fail, we will be
dropped out of school?

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.420
It's nothing like that, Tadokoro-chan.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.310
The purpose of this event
is for upper level students

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:24.820
to meet face-to-face and
create deep connections.

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:27.900
So it's really a leaf viewing meetingl...

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:31.080
But I wonder if I'll be able
to talk with upperclassmens

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:33.130
comfortably whom I'll
meet for the first time.

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:35.470
Don't worry, it's going to be alright!

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:37.310
I can directly meet the Elite Ten!

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:44.020
S-S-Souma-kun, what kind
of ideas are you getting?

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:47.600
There might be people who want
to challenge me to Shokugeki.

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:49.990
I knew it! Of course you can't do that!

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:52.050
Come on, I just want to try and see.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.180
It won't turn into anything dangerous right?

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.500
"Are you going to bet your
expulsion on the line?"

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:57.820
"Ahh, sure"

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:01.120
I can already see dangerous
scenario forming in my mind!

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:05.120
There are 6 more people who are
even better than Isshiki-senpai.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:07.210
I can't wait to see what
kind of people they are.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:10.480
Ehh... Souma-kun, honestly...

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:41.390
Ooh, you can see maple leaves
so easily here, Tadokoro!

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:44.130
Eh? What's the problem?

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:46.810
I'm so nervous!

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:51.050
I don't know if I'll be able to talk to
upperclassmens whom I have not met before.

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.960
Hey, why the heck you sat beside me?

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:55.580
Same here.

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:59.160
I don't want to be associated with people
who took second and third places.

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:04.260
Haven't you decided on
rematch with me, Aldini?

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:08.320
You are so huge I can't
see the leaves at all.

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:10.100
So that's what it is.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:16.000
Forget about senpais, our own group
doesn't get along with each other.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:18.310
Yukihira, what with this haido?

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:20.380
It's neither long, nor short!

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:22.830
You are right, I need to cut it.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:27.310
While I was at Shinomya's place at
Stagiare, I didn't have time for this.

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:29.590
Shinomya? The chef Shinomya?

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:30.750
Yes!

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:33.910
You are exceeding my
expectations like always.

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:37.790
Who would have thought you
would know such people.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.740
Interesting... My blood is boiling, Yukihira!

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:43.220
Takumi, your hair is so straight.

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:47.640
Of course it is. For the
chef it important not only-

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.300
Look at how strained you are.

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:51.950
We came here just for leaf viewing.

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:55.830
Your hairstyle is not
fit for a chef at all!

00:08:55.880 --> 00:09:00.480
Is that so? Just so you know, it
took a long time to style this hair.

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:04.300
Ooh, you hair is so smooth, Mimasaka.

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:06.470
It's none of your business!

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:08.090
Yo, Nakiri.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:09.970
Long time, no see.

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:13.650
Could you not talk to me with this tone?

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:18.240
By the way, Nakiri, you should not be sitting
here, you are with Elite Ten, aren't you?

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:21.730
The idea is that underclassmen
should come to know upperclassmen

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:23.910
So my place is here.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:26.140
Ah, I get it.

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:31.580
Erina-sama, aren't you going to thank
him for lending that shoujo manga?

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:34.930
Stuff like this should be
done sooner rather than later.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:39.350
To tell you the truth, this
manga helped him more than me.

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:41.660
So there is no need for me to thank him.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:43.290
Isn't that right, Yukihira-kun?

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:45.160
A-ah, yes, you are right.

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:47.890
Arato, we haven't seen each
other for a long time too

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:49.120
have you been doing good?

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:51.500
Yes, thanks to you.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:55.640
W-what? Hisako and Yukihira seems to be like good friends.

00:09:57.020 --> 00:10:01.710
Totsuki Elite Ten has arrived!

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:05.210
Here they are.

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:09.360
The best chefs of this academy.

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:31.120
Totsuki Elite Ten!

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:33.500
No appetite for some reason.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:35.670
If you eat too much, you'll get fat.

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.760
Really?

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:37.940
I'll be like bun then.

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:39.360
You'll be soft at least.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:40.490
Really?!

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:54.090
So she is one of the Elite Ten?

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:56.830
"Ah. my bad, my bad."

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.790
"Thank you very much, Yukihira Souma!"

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:01.980
So she is 2nd seat, huh?

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:07.600
Hey, lets wrap this up

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:10.940
And how about we cancel
this nonsense next year?

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:15.670
Don't you think this is too
boring and meaningless?

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:18.080
What do you think, cutie?

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:24.800
This is directive from school and
we can't just cancel it like that.

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:26.730
We don't have such authority.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:31.700
I wasn't asking this cutie about this,

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.400
I'm talking to youngsters right now.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:36.510
You are always so noisy.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:40.730
You are fussing over nothing.
Such a goody two shoes.

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:41.570
Die!

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:44.290
Such a shame, I didn't die at all!

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:49.370
Same as always, a dumbass
who only knows how to bark.

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:53.860
Good thing that Senzaimon
gave us unlimited budget.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:57.440
Be at least a little
considerate to old man.

00:11:57.890 --> 00:12:01.750
Haha, Eizan, all you think about is the money,

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:02.920
how boring.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:06.910
Let's hurry up and get out of Totsuki.

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:09.260
On the count of: Three, two, one!

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:10.630
Shut up, midget!

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.880
What did you say?!!

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:18.490
Guys, you are so energetic,
maybe have a drink?

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:22.450
Why the heck are you
telling us what to do, Issiki!!!

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:27.260
Their relationship is million
times worse then first years...

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:31.570
Hmm, this year they are all having fun.

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:34.940
They are future Elite Ten, after all.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:38.970
They'll become our future reigning elite.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:44.790
It will be beneficial for them to
have contact with current Elite Ten.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.720
Hmm, so she's called Rindou

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:51.040
2nd seat, Kobayashi-senpai.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:55.670
And besides her is person on first seat.

00:12:57.110 --> 00:12:58.110
Tsukasa Eishi.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:04.570
Yukihira Souma. Also, Takumi
Aldini and Mimasaka Subaru

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:07.900
You were on autumn selections.

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:17.460
Why did you arranged that Shokugeki?

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:26.120
I wanted selections to end as soon as
possible, but there were two Shokugekis.

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:29.090
Because of it, we had so much extra work.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.630
You know, like organizing stuff.

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:33.800
I'm all out of energy now.

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:37.760
That's why I told you to lead the scene

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.230
and leave organizing part to us.

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:41.950
No, no, no. I can't stand the scene!

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:45.090
And I already said that I entrust
you things like this to you.

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:50.170
<i>He doesn't look like first
seats we have seen before...</i>

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.930
Uh... oh... please excuse us.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.970
Please forgive us for the inconveniences.

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:00.570
Hey, Mimasaka, you apologize too.

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:03.070
It's because of you that those
Shokugekis started, isn't it?

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:04.410
Oh, you are right.

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:07.210
Please forgive us for
the inconveniences.

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:08.540
Hey, don't make a parody of me!

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:12.490
You can't change anything here anyway.

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:15.290
I'm so unfortunate for being first.

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:20.120
And all this responsibilities falls on me.
It's so hard.

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:25.540
Ooh, so much depression, it irritates me.

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.470
Ah, screw it, it's better for us.

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.660
Senpai, please hang in there for a little longer.

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:35.190
You know, lately I notice
that I sigh too much too.

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:39.500
Come on, Tsukasa, be more positive.

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:42.680
You scared all the first years.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:48.720
Well, he is like this, but at least he is good cook.

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:51.850
Please be easy on him, ok?

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:54.320
Tsukasa, good boy, good boy.

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:58.410
Y-you are right. So, why is the tea so sweet?

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:01.630
Hey, for starters, can I have a question?

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:03.550
What question?

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:09.820
I want to join Elite Ten, is there
anyone to willing to do Shokugeki?

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:11.170
Hey, Yukihira!

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:18.430
Eeh, maybe third year can't,
how about second year?

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:19.810
I won't.

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:20.830
I won't too.

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.310
Why would I do it?

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:27.810
Who would compete with you
anyway, you are just first year.

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:29.410
No offense, okay?

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:36.400
I'm sorry ok? Seriously, seriously, seriously.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:43.020
We second years are also
busy with battling third years, you know.

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:50.970
So it's like that, Yukihira-chin.

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:52.160
..chin?

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:55.470
Yukihira, you entered the academy
six month ago, didn't you?

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:58.830
You should already know how the Elite Ten works.

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:00.570
We don't go battling left and right-

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:03.600
So, maybe you'll wager your seat?

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:07.990
I just want to battle strong opponents more.

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:12.020
And we can battle for seat in Elite Ten later too.

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:15.680
You didn't understand anything, Yukihira-chin.

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:19.410
I'm telling about the situation as a whole.

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:20.800
Aah, just listen to me!

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:23.660
The Elite Ten aren't as simple as you think.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:25.810
We are not like other students.

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:27.900
Did you understand, Yukihira-chin?

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:33.320
Elite Ten are people with different talents.

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:37.410
They receive all the food and drink they would like

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:42.530
even if all the chefs in Japan are dreaming about them.

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:46.650
They have access to all the recipes
that came out in past 1000 year.

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:49.780
And that is huge amount of books!

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:52.470
And that is The Elite Ten of Totsuki, do you understand?

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:56.080
Understand, so you are all so cool
in the Elite Ten, aren't you?

00:16:56.750 --> 00:17:02.230
You didn't understand anything! That's just new level of stupidity!

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:04.330
Listen to me, Souma-kun.

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:10.700
Once you enter Elite Ten, you put
your hands on unlimited resources.

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:14.290
They differ from others with their quality.

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:19.920
Also, the higher seat you are,
the more privileges you'll have.

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:24.160
Because food in this school
is everything, isn't it?

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:26.450
Hehe, this school is really crazy.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:32.690
With such a short life, food is
very broad field to operate in.

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:36.360
You can't encompass it even with your whole life.

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:41.230
But entering the Elite Ten will enable
you to tread further than anyone else.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:46.800
Totsuki gives the strong the power and
resources to broaden themselves.

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:50.850
And council of Ten gets absolutely everything.

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:58.480
Oh, come on, let's all have fun today.

00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:01.250
We have prepared a surprise for you.

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:02.660
Yes, Momo?

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:04.730
There is no need to address me.

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:12.300
Today, 4th seat, Akanegakubo Momo
has prepared sweets to go with tea for us.

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:16.050
Actually, I was reluctant to make these.

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:19.070
I just had nothing better to do.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:21.220
It was so troublesome.

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:25.160
Tehe, she repeated two times,
you are embarrassing me.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:29.440
Ok, bring us our sweets.

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:33.130
Erina-sama, did you know?

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:34.860
No, I didn't.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:39.150
Excuse me, but what dishes
does 4th seat prepare?

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:43.100
Lets see, she specializes
in Western sweets.

00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:49.540
Her excellent technique and
impeccable feeling of

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:54.850
beautiful. She is best
confectioner in Totsuki.

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:56.810
So, it's like that.

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:01.890
You most likely want to taste
what did 4th seat prepared.

00:19:13.190 --> 00:19:14.190
Maple cake?

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:17.620
It's essential for sweets to
have beautiful appearance.

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:20.670
Transparent like shop-window.

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:22.510
Excellent caramel.

00:19:23.110 --> 00:19:24.690
Cranberry layers.

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:29.030
From the scent of it, I can
say it has cheese mousse.

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:30.110
Thank you for the food.

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:34.070
This cake has perfect balance
of low-calorie sugar.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:41.160
What a perfect taste!

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:45.560
There is cranberry jelly underneath
cheese mousse and apple jelly under that!

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:49.660
Also, there is hidden flavor, it's walnut!

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:53.620
I have never tasted such a cake.

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:58.690
Momo's sweets are just always delicious!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:05.370
Cranberry sauce brings all
the ingredients together!

00:20:05.920 --> 00:20:10.180
And gentle sponge cake separates
itself from the walnut!

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:15.390
Amazing cheese balance! Amazing taste!

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:18.210
And it's not just sweet for the tea,

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:22.490
it's a whole new world inside!

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:29.370
So, these are the strongest
chefs in Totsuki?

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:31.910
Elite Ten!

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:33.700
I hope you understand.

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:38.590
The Elite Ten has absolute power.

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:41.130
And this is undisputed reality.

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:50.970
So, that is the case.

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:54.560
I hope you understood all the nuances.

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:59.000
I really, really, really don't
have anything against you.

00:20:59.560 --> 00:21:02.620
But as chefs, you still
have long way to grow.

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:11.950
But, if you have even one
thing to beat me at,

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:14.590
Then I will consider doing
Shokugeki with you.

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:16.020
Midget.

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:18.670
Shut up, you damn witch!

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:21.370
Are you being serious right now, Kuga-senpai?

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:24.730
It's true, It's true, It's true, trust me.

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:27.550
But this is not possible.

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:30.850
Ok, now that we had tea, we can go.

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:35.230
Yes, this is me. Did you prepare
sesame seeds? I'll be there soon.

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:39.460
It annoys me that only I
was forced to work here.

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:41.960
Good that we managed to end this so quickly.

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:52.650
Let's not hold this next year, ok?

00:21:56.160 --> 00:22:02.510
Fight! Because only in competitions
the flame shines most brightly.

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:13.620
Souma-kun.

00:23:14.840 --> 00:23:17.310
Do you reminisce about Maple meeting?

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:19.480
Well, yeah.

00:23:20.090 --> 00:23:24.170
Members of Elite Ten also surprised me.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:26.770
I don't even know-

00:23:26.910 --> 00:23:28.110
It doesn't matter!

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:34.860
Maybe I too don't come
to the senpais' level

00:23:35.340 --> 00:23:39.070
but that doesn't mean I can't
defeat them in the future.

00:23:39.990 --> 00:23:43.020
Let's move slowly to the Elite Ten, ok?

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:46.900
Yeah, you are right.

00:23:48.330 --> 00:23:50.130
I'm not even halfway there.

00:23:50.940 --> 00:23:54.030
First we need to meet senpais conditions.

00:23:54.210 --> 00:23:57.670
I'll definitely find something
that will defeat him!
